      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twatuyenu, tufuntenu kudi Yehova; muloŋa yena natutabuli, wukutúuka nawa; yena natweti, wukukasakasahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwakahita mafuku ayedi wakatuhizumwisha; hefuku damu chisatu wakatuhindwisha, twakahanda kumesu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twilukenu, tudishuku kulonda tumwiluki Yehova, kusolomoka kwindi kudi neyi kucha, hikwakujinokaku. Wakenza kudetu neyi chenzaŋa nvula jamusanvu, neyi nvula jamayinza jazoweshaŋa iseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Efweremi, nikwili ŋahi? Eyi Yuda, nikwili ŋahi? Kukeŋa kweyi kudi neyi ivu dabudidi, kudi neyi wuumi wafumaŋa swayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nayitemi dehi nawatuprofwetu; nayijahi dehi namazu akukanwa kami; wuŋaji weyi wachaŋa to-o neyi mwaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nakeŋa luwi, bayi kuketula yimunaku; nakeŋa kwiluka kwakumwiluka Nzambi, chakubadika nyilambu yakushita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa wena adi neyi Adama, anamotoki dehi chitiyaŋenu; kwenoku anankwatili makasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gileyadi himukala wawantu akoŋaŋa yakuluwa, wachinana dehi namashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chabelaminaŋawu muntu kudi yendu yawakwakubuwa, dimu nawa mwakajahilawu antu kudi nyikanka yawatupristu munjila yakuya kuShekemi; mwalala, anakoŋi yakubajama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi akwamutaŋa waIsarela namonuku chuma chi kweti niŋaŋanyi; wuvumbi waEfweremi wamwekana dehi kwenoku, Isarela wajilola dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nineyi Yuda anakutoŋweli dehi kwaŋula kuwakaaŋuleyi chinakaleta cheŋi antu ami ayili muwukoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
